    "blurb": "Interact with the SpaceTraders API",
    "overview": "An SDK to play SpaceTraders from a Camunda process.  It makes the interaction with the API easy by providing one connector for all endpoints, from purchasing a ship to miring ore.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
