  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Play SpaceTraders from Camunda Processes",
    "splashDescription": "SpaceTraders is a programmable fleet-management game played through a headless API. In the game, you can purchase a ship, navigate to an asteroid field, mine ore, sell goods, and deliver goods to fulfill your contract. And this is just the beginning!\n\nThe SDK makes it easy for you to interact with the SpaceTrader API from your process.",
